WEBVTT

00:09:29.189 --> 00:09:32.568
Twerking is a deep,
soulful, spiritual practice.

00:09:32.568 --> 00:09:33.611
It’s hip-opening.

00:09:34.111 --> 00:09:35.195
It’s empowering.

00:09:35.738 --> 00:09:37.239
When performed as the mapouka,

00:09:37.239 --> 00:09:39.033
it’s said to connect you to God.

00:09:39.366 --> 00:09:40.367
It’s sacred.

00:09:40.743 --> 00:09:43.495
And now we’re practicing
that on mainstream stages.

00:09:43.871 --> 00:09:46.290
We're practicing that at home,

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:50.336
and it's contributing to the liberation
of women and people around the world.

00:09:50.878 --> 00:09:52.379
Twerking is good for humanity.

00:09:52.838 --> 00:09:54.173
(Laughter)

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.675
Forty years ago,

00:09:56.675 --> 00:09:59.678
when Black and brown people in New York
invented break dancing,

00:09:59.678 --> 00:10:00.888
it was villainized.